# Usmanian agent rule

Before exploring the whole repo, read **`cursor.md`** at the project root. It is the handbook for product purpose, architecture, routes, DB, brand, and safe change patterns.

Also skim **`usmanian.md`** for brand tokens when touching UI.

## Preserve

- CID + admin approval gate; verified-only social access (RLS)
- Friend consent; anonymous teacher-report privacy
- Brand tokens / Inter / UPSS shield — no AI-purple or mock-data regressions
- Mobile AppShell (Header, BottomNav, bottom sheets, safe areas)

## Edit style

- Data through `src/lib/api/*`; types in `types/database.ts` + `types/models.ts`
- New schema = new migration + RLS; update `cursor.md` when structure changes
- Prefer extending existing feed/card/shell patterns over new visual systems
